1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,562
Learning to code is hard enough.

2
00:00:02,612 --> 00:00:06,191
Learning it in a language you
don't think in is harder.

3
00:00:06,591 --> 00:00:12,577
Pick a topic, like Python loops. Professor
Qubirex teaches it in Telugu,

4
00:00:12,627 --> 00:00:14,002
Hindi or the mix.

5
00:00:14,402 --> 00:00:19,948
See the code, line by line, with the
voice walking you through it.

6
00:00:20,348 --> 00:00:24,380
Practise with hints, and run real tests.

7
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,881
When you're ready, a fresh check proves
you can do it on your own.

8
00:00:30,281 --> 00:00:36,221
Every skill you prove goes on your
signed Capability Passport.

9
00:00:36,621 --> 00:00:40,966
Qubirex. Your language. Your
skills. Your future.
